{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261113/photo/bkn-20261113114302380-1113_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261113115128\"/><p>失蹤女童蕭樂瑤。</p><p>一名14歲女童蕭樂瑤於本周三(11日)上午離開其位於馬鞍山耀安邨的住所後便告失蹤，其家人同日報案。</p><p>她身高約1.5米，體重約40公斤，瘦身材，尖面型，黃皮膚及蓄長黑髮。她最後露面時身穿白色恤衫、藍色短裙、深色外套、黑色皮鞋，以及攜有一個黑色背包。</p><p>任何人如有該失蹤女子的消息或曾見過她，請與執法部門聯絡。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T04:15:25.572206+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T03:43:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T07:22:13.889843+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T04:08:58.165418+00:00","content_hash":"9e5598ff69a4fa2adc4afeaa0d686a8c7a12e82c7d3459af2718426d3068459f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}